WEBVTT

00:09:56.911 --> 00:10:00.021
na kuonewa na kupigwa
na kudhalilishwa na walimu.

00:10:01.757 --> 00:10:04.383
Na Angelika na wengine kama yeye

00:10:04.407 --> 00:10:07.994
hawatakuwa tena kama bidhaa
inayoletwa mtandaoni

00:10:08.018 --> 00:10:10.910
kuwafurahisha watu wazima
walioko maili nyingi mbali.

00:10:11.887 --> 00:10:13.619
Lakini kuzidisha manufaa ya kijamii,

00:10:13.643 --> 00:10:16.172
ya kiuchumi na kitamaduni
ya hiyo.

00:10:16.196 --> 00:10:19.133
Kuzidisha hiyo kwa kila familia,
kila jamii,

00:10:19.157 --> 00:10:21.156
kijiji, mji, jiji, nchi

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.180
na ghafla, umepata
utaratibu mpya umezaliwa.

00:10:24.204 --> 00:10:28.050
Kizazi kitachipua
bila kupitia ukatili.

00:10:29.383 --> 00:10:30.717
Itatuhitaji sisi sote.